I take my phone.
I call home to Mexico.
My mother answers.
"Hi, Mom," I say.
It is nice to hear her voice.
"Are you in Denmark now?" she asks.
"Yes, I am in Copenhagen," I say.
"And I am well."
I also hear my dad.
"Hi, Maya!" he says.
"My new job starts on Monday," I say.
"How exciting," my mother says.
I say goodbye and smile.
